  "notes": "Three-pane RSS-style reader (QMReader). Warm off-white sidebar (#f6f6f5) vs white list/reader panes; monogram letter tiles stand in for source favicons. Unread items marked with a small blue dot (accent hex approximate) and bold title; read items in regular weight. Reading pane uses a serif body with a highlighted (yellow underline/mark) passage, a '完' end ornament with reading time, and a next-article card with a 'J' keyboard hint. Toolbar has 中文/原文 translation toggle, Aa reading settings (light/护眼 sepia/dark, font families, size, line spacing, column width), overflow menu (copy, immersive reading, delete), and a hidden AI chat side panel with suggestion chips and model picker (seen live, not in capture, so not coded). Sidebar groups sources by type (文章/资讯/播客/社区/微信公众号) with add buttons. First viewport shows '40+' capped count while the full capture shows 134."
